+## Paths
+
+```
+.atomic-skills/projects/<project-id>/<plan-slug>/flow/flow.json   # L1 SoT
+.atomic-skills/projects/<project-id>/<plan-slug>/flow/flow.html   # generated, NEVER map.html
+```
