+## Grammar
+
+```
+/atomic-skills:project flow [<path-to-source.md>] [--check] [--open] [--strict]
+/atomic-skills:project flow --plan <path-to-source.md> [--check] [--open] [--strict]
+/atomic-skills:project process   → same as flow (alias)
